      "Untemplated records of the same races: `EncDragonPriest` (on *Dragon Priests*), `DLC2FrostGiant01` 01CAD6:Dragonborn.esm (level 32, on *Giant*).",
      "Every row: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "Every other record (the Sovngarde copies `MQ206Gormlaith`, `MQ206Felldir`, `MQ206Hakon`, which template the summons) carries `Stats` and follows its template."
